<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="charlie-sf" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Stir Fry (Charlie)</title>

  <p>
    Ingredients
  </p>
  <tabular>
    <row>
      <cell>Canola oil</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Garlic</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Ginger</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
    <cell>Green onions</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Broccoli</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Mushrooms</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Bok choy</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Chicken (1+ pounds) or super firm tofu</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><alert>Stir Fry Sauce</alert></cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

  <p>Instructions
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p>
          Cook garlic, ginger, and green onions in canola oil for 10 seconds
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Add in other ingredients in reverse order of time needed to cook.  Bok choy, sauce, and any additional flavorings come last.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Cook for 1 minute.  Done.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </p>

  <p>
    Notes:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          You may notice the lack of quantities for the ingredients. Use whatever makes sense to you.  It is hard to get the <q>proportions</q> incorrect.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</section>